# Per-user CLAUDE.md - real file lives at <vault>/persona/CLAUDE.md, symlinked
# into the repo root (Claude Code auto-loads CLAUDE.md from cwd). Template:
# CLAUDE.example.md. Setup wizard wires this up.
# CRON.md isn't here because it lives directly at <vault>/persona/CRON.md;
# bin/cron-daemon.ts reads $VAULT_PATH/persona/CRON.md, no repo-root copy.
CLAUDE.md

# Personal skill content lives in <vault>/persona/.claude/skills/ and is
# symlinked into .claude/skills/ per-skill by bin/link-skills.sh. None of
# those symlinks belong in git. /setup is provided as a slash command at
# .claude/commands/setup.md (tracked) so it works on a fresh clone before
# any skill symlinks exist.
.claude/skills/

# Editor swap files
*.swp
*.swo
